e\\\\\` if it comes from the protocol, or leaving it unset if it's only populated later by provider \\\\\`enrich\\\\\`.\\npackages/core/src/acp/acp-transcript-parser/__snapshots__/acp-transcript-parser.fixture.test.ts.snap:253:The two load-bearing spots are the union definition and \\\\\`toAgentUpdate\\\\\` (both in \\\\\`agent-update.ts\\\\\`); everything else is passthrough plus deciding whether the renderer should surface \\\\\`foo\\\\\`.\\",\\npackages/core/src/acp/acp-transcript-parser/fixtures/claude-acp-transcript.json:1125:            \\"text\\": \\"Search the codebase for the definition of \`toAgentUpdate\` — give the file path and line number.\\"\\npackages/core/src/acp/acp-transcript-parser/fixtures/claude-acp-transcript.json:1167:            \\"text\\": \\"toAgentUpdate\` in the codebase. I should use the Bash tool to grep for this function\\",\\npackages/core/src/acp/acp-transcript-parser/fixtures/claude-acp-transcript.json:1222:          \\"title\\": \\"grep -rn \\\\\\"toAgentUpdate\\\\\\" /private/tmp/gugu-acp-fixture-1783037827823 --include=\\\\\\"*.ts\\\\\\" --include=\\\\\\"*.tsx\\\\\\" | head -20\\",\\npackages/core/src/acp/acp-transcript-parser/fixtures/claude-acp-transcript.json:1226:                \\"text\\": \\"Search for toAgentUpdate definition in codebase\\",\\npackages/core/src/acp/acp-transcript-parser/fixtures/claude-acp-transcript.json:1233:            \\"command\\": \\"grep -rn \\\\\\"toAgentUpdate\\\\\\" /private/tmp/gugu-acp-fixture-1783037827823 --include=\\\\\\"*.ts\\\\\\" --include=\\\\\\"*.tsx\\\\\\" | head -20\\",\\npackages/core/src/acp/acp-transcript-parser/fixtures/claude-acp-transcript.json:1234:            \\"description\\": \\"Search for toAgentUpdate definition in codebase\\"\\npackages/core/src/acp/acp-transcript-parser/fixtures/claude-acp-transcript.json:1269:                \\"stdout\\": \\"/private/tmp/gugu-acp-fixture-1783037827823/packages/core/src/agents/plugins/capabilities/acp.ts:85:   * \`toAgentUpdate\` conver