          "role": "assistant",
          "seq": 8,
          "text": "\`agent-update.ts\` defines the provider-neutral \`AgentUpdate\` shape and \`toAgentUpdate()\`, which decodes raw ACP \`SessionUpdate\` messages into that internal vocabulary. \`session-machine.ts\` consumes those \`AgentUpdate\` values in commands/events, appending them to active turns, assigning sequence numbers, committing completed turns, and emitting update effects for the runtime or renderer.",
